nearby Nod base. Locate the missing scientists.","x":15.37,"y":51.04,"floor":2},{"kind":"secret","name":"Disable Airstrip","type":"Hidden","text":"Disabling of the Nod Airstrip has hampered the ability to fly in new vehicle reinforcements to the base area.","x":88.65,"y":15.63,"floor":1},{"kind":"secret","name":"Destroy Tiberium Silos","type":"Hidden","text":"Disabling the Nod Tiberium Silos has cut into Nod production capabilities, by reducing their funding.","x":88.82,"y":15.81,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Obelisk","pog":"m07_2_05","type":"Side","action":"Disable","text":"The Obelisk is a deadly defense weapon, but it requires power to operate. If you cannot get inside to disable it, consider removing the power source.","x":88.63,"y":15.34,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Dam Master Control Terminal","pog":"m02_1_03","type":"Main","action":"Destroy","text":"The Master Control Terminal inside the dam controls the large bay door on top. Disabling this terminal will not only open the door, it will prevent Nod from using this dam as a secondary power source.","x":88.48,"y":15.89,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Hand of Nod","pog":"m02_2_01","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Disabling the Hand of Nod will dramatically hamper reinforcements for this area. Consider using an Ion Cannon Beacon if you have one.","x":88.95,"y":15.57,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Infiltrate Cargo Plane","pog":"m02_1_04","type":"Main","action":"Capture","text":"Approach the Cargo Plane from the rear to pursue the scientists.","x":88.37,"y":15.43,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Helipad","pog":"m02_2_02","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Disable the Nod Helipad to reduce Apache encounters throughout this area. This will force them to refuel at another location.","x":88.74,"y":16.02,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Secure Guard Tower","pog":"m02_2_03","type":"Side","action":"Eliminate","text":"This checkpoint is held by the Nod Guard Tower on top of the hill. Eliminate all enemy resistance and then secure the tower to allow the GDI assault to progress.","x":88.82,"y":15.25,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Secure Second House","pog":"m02_2_06","type":"Side","action":"Eliminate","text":"Another house occupied by Nod soldiers, potentially the location of the Nod Officer coordinating with Command for reinforcements. Eliminate all enemies in the surrounding area and then enter the house to secure this objective.","x":88.27,"y":15.79,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Secure First House","pog":"m02_2_05","type":"Side","action":"Eliminate","text":"Nod occupies several of the houses in this area, and GDI needs to secure them all. Eliminate all enemies in the surrounding area and then enter the building to secure this objective.","x":89.04,"y":15.82,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Secure Third House","pog":"m02_2_04","type":"Side","action":"Eliminate","text":"This house is being used by an officer who is coordinating with Command for reinforcements. Eliminate the Nod Officer and all nearby reinforcements, then enter the house to secure this objective.","x":88.46,"y":15.17,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Secure Ski Resort","pog":"m02_2_07","type":"Side","action":"Eliminate","text":"Nod is using this checkpoint to refuel their defensive line. Eliminate all enemy resistance and then secure the building front.","x":88.51,"y":16.15,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable First SAM Site","pog":"m02_2_08","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Disabling this SAM Site will improve local air superiority for GDI. Consider using C4 to destroy this emplacement.","x":89.08,"y":15.35,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Destroy Nod Convoy","pog":"m02_2_09","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"The convoy trucks in this area are transporting supplies toward the battle front. Eliminate all three supply trucks to complete this objective.","x":88.14,"y":15.5,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Second SAM Site","pog":"m02_2_10","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Disabling this SAM Site will improve local air superiority for GDI. Consider using C4 to destroy this emplacement.","x":88.96,"y":16.14,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Third SAM Site","pog":"m02_2_11","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Disabling this SAM Site will improve local air superiority for GDI. Consider using C4 to destroy this emplacement.","x":88.72,"y":14.99,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Fourth SAM Site","pog":"m02_2_12","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Disabling this SAM Site will improve local air superiority for GDI. Consider using C4 to destroy this emplacement.","x":88.2,"y":16.07,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Disable Power Plant","pog":"m02_2_13","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Power Plants provide energy for other Nod structures. Disabling this Power Plant will shut down the Obelisk. Assault the building from the interior, as it is being repaired by a Nod Engineer.","x":89.26,"y":15.66,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Destroy Tiberium Machine Alpha","pog":"m02_2_14","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Nod has three Tiberium research machines located throughout this cavern area. Destroy this machine to hamper Nod Tiberium research.","x":88.19,"y":15.12,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Destroy Tiberium Machine Beta","pog":"m02_2_14","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Nod has three Tiberium research machines located throughout this cavern area. Destroy this machine to hamper Nod Tiberium research.","x":88.68,"y":16.39,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Destroy Tiberium Machine Gamma","pog":"m02_2_14","type":"Side","action":"Destroy","text":"Nod has three Tiberium research machines located throughout this cavern area. Destroy this machine to hamper Nod Tiberium research.","x":89.09,"y":15.03,"floor":1},{"kind":"objective","name":"Acquire Mammoth Tank","pog":"m02_2_15","type":"Side","action":"Acquire","text":"GDI has airdropped a Mammoth Tank for your use. Acquire the Mammoth Tank and use it to your advantage.","x":87.94,"y":15.74,"floor":1}]